WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.530
Help customers understand their selection
and get a clear answer when something needs

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:05.060
a closer look.

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:08.513
Start with the current physical sample and
the customer's approved species and

00:00:08.513 --> 00:00:11.417
finish. Keep the selection record handy so
everyone is looking at the same starting

00:00:11.417 --> 00:00:14.320
point.

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:18.600
Look at the actual pieces in consistent
lighting. Photos are helpful for sharing a

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.330
concern, but they can change how color
appears.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:26.307
Use the factory's current guidance to talk
through natural grain and color

00:00:26.307 --> 00:00:29.733
differences. Set expectations around the
material while leaving room for the factory

00:00:29.733 --> 00:00:33.160
to review a specific concern.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:37.037
If you're unsure, gather clear photos and
selection details for the factory team. Let

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:40.363
the customer know what you're checking and
when you'll update them, even if the

00:00:40.363 --> 00:00:43.690
answer is still pending.
